## Troubleshooting Quick Reference

* **`Connection closed by UNKNOWN port 65535`:** Usually caused by SSH failing authentication on the first hop (the bastion host) because the bastion's `.pem` key 
was not supplied to `ProxyJump`. Using `~/.ssh/config` with distinct `IdentityFile` entries resolves this.
* **`Connection timed out`:** Indicates a missing route in either VPC A or one of the AZ subnet route tables in VPC B, or a Security Group / Network ACL blocking TCP port `22`.
* **Diagnostic Command:** Run `ssh -v vpc-b-instance-1` to inspect verbose logs and confirm whether authentication fails on Hop 1 (Bastion) or Hop 2 (VPC B target).
